 the addition of palmitate</article-title><source>Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. USA.</source><volume>92</volume><year>1995</year><fpage>5987</fpage><lpage>5991</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7597066</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Danielietal1996"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Danieli</surname><given-names>T.</given-names></name><name><surname>Pelletier</surname><given-names>S.L.</given-names></name><name><surname>Henis</surname><given-names>Y.I.</given-names></name><name><surname>White</surname><given-names>J.M.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Membrane fusion mediated by the influenza virus hemagglutinin requires the concerted action of at least three hemagglutinin trimers</article-title><source>J. Cell Biol.</source><volume>133</volume><year>1996</year><fpage>559</fpage><lpage>569</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8636231</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Dascheretal1994"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dascher</surname><given-names>C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Matteson</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Balch</surname><given-names>W.E.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Syntaxin 5 regulates endoplasmic reticulum to Golgi transport</article-title><source>J. Biol. Chem.</source><volume>269</volume><year>1994</year><fpage>29363</fpage><lpage>29366</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7961911</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="GaynorandEmr1997"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gaynor</surname><given-names>E.C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Emr</surname><given-names>S.D.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>COPI-independent anterograde transportcargo-selective ER to Golgi protein transport in yeast COPI mutants</article-title><source>J. Cell Biol.</source><volume>136</volume><year>1997</year><fpage>789</fpage><lpage>80